### 1. Create category with description (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dresses",
  "description": "Evening and prom dresses"
}

### 2. Create category without description (expect 201, description null)
POST http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shoes"
}

### 3. Empty name (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### 4. Duplicate name (expect: ?)
POST http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dresses"
}

### 5. List categories (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/categories

### 6. Missing category (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/categories/999

### 7. Invalid id (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/categories/abc

### 8a. Update description (expect 200)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/categories/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Long evening"
}

### Rename to an existing name (expect 409)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bags"
}

### 8b. Check the update was saved (expect the new description)
GET http://localhost:3000/categories/1

### 9a. Delete category (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/categories/2

### 9b. Check it is gone (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/categories/2

### Rename to an existing name (expect 409)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dresses"
}